ate_password(n))\n\n\n## Exercise 5:\n\nCreate a Python program to calculate the nth Fibonacci number. The Fibonacci sequence is a series of numbers in which each number is the sum of the two preceding ones, usually starting with 0 and 1. \n\n# Solution:\n\ndef fibonacci(n):\n    if n <= 1:\n        return n\n    else:\n        return fibonacci(n-1) + fibonacci(n-2)\n\nn = int(input(\"Enter the number of terms: \"))\nprint(\"Fibonacci series:\")\nfor i in range(n):\n    print(fibonacci(i))\n\n\n",
